  "details": "Opened VRChat in desktop mode on two computers, both launched with the \"Fionna\" account.  One computer was logged out using the in-game menu and another VRChat account \"B M O\" logged in.  \"Real\" Fionna invited B M O from the social menu.  In that world, B M O appeared as \"Fionna\" both to the original Fionna and to a third party.  The displayed avatar was B M O, but the social menu and nameplate said it was Fionna.  \n\n(Fionna is friends with B M O but not herself so she saw B M O as Trusted rank.  B M O saw original Fionna as Friend rank.  )\n\nFIonna's log https://drive.google.com/open?id=1vlLSFUFXD5ltRa0yCSzNvQ5HYHjGglxJ\n\nB M O log:  https://drive.google.com/open?id=1LE-o9llq8_n7DzUjjcWCx_OqOO32hHxf\n\nPhotos: one showing both computers and two Fionnas, the other a screenshot from a third person not on the same local network.",
